# Wiring Strategy - Reuse vs Rebuild

```yaml
header:
  id: STRATEGY://brain.wiring
  intent: PRINCIPLE
```

## CAEM/FES Principle

```text
ONE PARSER
MULTIPLE CONSUMERS
```

## Reuse First

| Component | Source | Action |
|-----------|--------|--------|
| GGUF Header Parse | hacedle/x/loader/gguf/header.rs | ✅ REUSE |
| GGUF Tensor Index | hacedle/x/loader/gguf/tensor_index.rs | ✅ REUSE |
| GGUF Mmap | hacedle/x/loader/gguf/mmap.rs | ✅ REUSE |
| Candle Inference | hacedle/x/provider/candle/inference.rs | ✅ REUSE |
| Tokenizer | tokenizers crate | ✅ REUSE |

## No Rebuild

DO NOT create:
- brain/master/src/gguf_header.rs (exists in hacedle)
- brain/master/src/tensor_index.rs (exists in hacedle)
- brain/master/src/candle_inference.rs (exists in hacedle)

## Wire Pattern

```rust
// brain/master/wires_to_hacedle.rs
use hacedle::x::loader::gguf::GgufLoader;
use hacedle::x::provider::candle::InferenceEngine;
use tokenizers::Tokenizer;
```